    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que cuenta los pacientes clasificados por género, año de observación y rangos de edad decenales al inicio de su seguimiento:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    p.gender_concept_id,\n    vc.concept_name AS gender_concept_name,\n    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM op.observation_period_start_date) AS observation_year,\n    TRUNC(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_start_date, p.birth_datetime, YEAR) / 10) * 10 AS age_band_start,\n    (TRUNC(DATE_DIFF(op.observation_period_start_date, p.birth_datetime, YEAR) / 10) * 10) + 9 AS age_band_end,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT p.person_id) AS number_of_patients\nFROM\n    person AS p\nJOIN\n    observation_period AS op\nON\n    p.person_id = op.person_id\nJOIN\n    concept AS vc\nON\n    p.gender_concept_id = vc.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    p.gender_concept_id,\n    gender_concept_name,\n    observation_year,\n    age_band_start,\n    age_band_end\nORDER BY\n    observation_year,\n    gender_concept_name,\n    age_band_start\n```\n"
          }
        ],
        "role": "model"
      },
